        <tr> 
          <td colspan="2">
<font face="Verdana" size="2"><B>SoF's first valiant attempt at Trakanon.                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                              </B></font><P>
<font face="Verdana" size="2">I was so happy to be a part of this attempt on Trak. =)<br><br>SoF rounded up troops and hit Seb by storm, taking down Juggs and Reets as we went. <br><br>**Btw, we have two of the best pullers in the game. WTG Bhhaal and Charisi for clearing Trak's lair their first time pulling it!!** <br><br>Fighting against LD's, Jugg repop's and Tola gating, we managed to finally make a run at Trak. Sadelia ran in to get aggro and all of a sudden somehow Trak was right on top of us on the walkway to his Lair. Then poof, he was no where in sight! We charged the lair ready for battle, but no Trak. /boggled, I looked around, seeing Sanadan's life falling fast and saw Trak in the moat. I shouted for everyone to hit the water, but by this time the rythmn of the raid was way off. No way for the group heals to work, etc. since we were scattered on the bank and in the water. Nevertheless, I charged in the water nuking Trak while blind. We had him down to half before I bit the bullet. Since we were really fighting him in waves and not all at once, unfortunately we TPW'd. I know without a doubt that if we were fighting him in his lair, he would be dead at our feet right now. But such is life in EQ, you live and learn and the next time we meet with Trakanon will be bitter sweet revenge.<br><br>Big thanx to Hannem and Kirrov for summoning and bonking us all back to life and staying up late to finish! Joo ROxxOrs!!<br><br>/cheer SoF. It was a great first try at Trak and I am confident our next one will be successful!<br><br>/salute                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                     </font>
</td>
